{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\" version=\"1.0\" datamodel=\"ecmascript\" initial=\"a\"><datamodel><data id=\"x\" expr=\"0\"/></datamodel><state id=\"a\"><transition event=\"go\" cond=\"x = = 3\" target=\"b\"/><transition event=\"h\" cond=\"x == = 3\" target=\"b\"/><transition event=\"i\" cond=\"x !== = 3\" target=\"b\"/></state><final id=\"b\"/></scxml>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml038-spaced-equality-variants.scxml"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":0,"notes":0,"total":3,"warnings":3},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml038-spaced-equality-variants.scxml"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":1,"byteOffset":188,"endColumn":190,"endLine":1,"startColumn":189,"startLine":1},"insertedContent":{"text":""}}]}],"description":{"text":"compare with `==`"},"properties":{"applicability":"maybe-incorrect"}}],"level":"warning","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml038-spaced-equality-variants.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":191,"endLine":1,"startColumn":190,"startLine":1}}}],"message":{"markdown":"ecmascript syntax error in `cond`: unexpected `=` where an operand was expected\n\n**Note:** a condition that cannot be parsed raises `error.execution` and evaluates as false, so this condition can never hold\n\n**Help:** `= =` is not an operator; write `==` without the space to compare\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §5.9 Expressions\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §B.2 The ECMAScript Data Model","text":"ecmascript syntax error in `cond`: unexpected `=` where an operand was expected"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":190,"start":189},"category":"lint"},"relatedLocations":[{"id":1,"message":{"text":"while parsing this `cond`"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/u